# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — GREENPATH FARM TO MARKET AI
## Complete React.js Frontend, Enterprise UI/UX, Marketplace, Financial Intelligence and Role-Based Administration

Act as a world-class senior frontend architect, enterprise SaaS product designer, UI/UX specialist, React.js engineer, data visualization engineer, and agricultural fintech product architect.

Your responsibility is to build a complete, visually exceptional, fully navigable frontend for **GreenPathFarm to Market AI**, an AI-integrated agricultural marketplace designed for Ethiopia.

This is an existing business system with an established Django backend, APIs, user roles, permissions, financial workflows, registration processes, and a separate DriverApp integration.

You must design the frontend around the actual system architecture and business rules described below.

The objective is to generate a complete working React.js frontend with a live preview, not just a landing page, static mockup, or design concept.

